<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <OutputType>Exe</OutputType>
    <RootNamespace>DidComm.Samples.ProfilesAndI18n</RootNamespace>
    <AssemblyName>DidComm.Samples.ProfilesAndI18n</AssemblyName>
    <IsPackable>false</IsPackable>
    <Description>didcomm-dotnet profiles and i18n — accept-based profile selection over an OOB invitation and a DID document's service accept array (Profiles + ProfileNegotiator), the mismatch path with a problem-report, the spec's chess example with lang / accept-lang headers, the FR-I18N-02 thread-scoped language preference honored on a follow-up and isolated from concurrent threads (IThreadStateStore), and the w.msg.bad-lang report when no acceptable language exists (PRD §14.3 sample 10, task BB, FR-PROF-01/02, FR-I18N-01..04).</Description>
